  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you activate your Rage, you can take on the form of a divine warrior for 1 minute or until you drop to 0 Hit Points. Once you use this feature, you can't do so again until you finish a Long Rest. While in this form, you gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Flight.</strong> You have a Fly Speed equal to your Speed and can hover.</p><p><strong>Resistance.</strong> You have Resistance to Necrotic, Psychic, and Radiant damage.</p><p><strong>Revivification.</strong> When a creature within 30 feet of you would drop to 0 Hit Points, you can take a Reaction to expend a use of your Rage to change its Hit Points to your Barbarian level instead.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-43axZ7b6HIuMwZpU\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Revivification heals the creature by your Barbarian level from 0: set its Hit Points to that number.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
